WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
No

2
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:02,400
There are wild boars and wolves in the mountains

3
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:03,520
No joke

4
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:06,670
Shenxi is better

5
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:08,870
She won't fawn over me just because I have a job.

6
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:10,830
You won’t dislike me just because I’m poor.

7
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:18,240
