10
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:24,910
Brother Qin

11
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:26,310
I just want to follow you

12
00:00:26,310 --> 00:00:27,350
Want to learn skills

13
00:00:27,350 --> 00:00:35,310
